title: Maybe highlight that a mention uses an alternate title.
pid: f1bcae2d-051c-476c-834e-4664b5bf6165
body: |2-
  This is only moderately interesting.
  If the herald highlights it, it should only be highlighted high enough
  to interest the user in [[id:ce67410c-fd75-4034-887f-313036eeee5f][classifying what the target thinks of the link]].
